%>as Michel Goossens pointed out to me today, the logical extension of
%>`PiffMarkUp' is that tabular data should be supplied as just a data
%>set, which the style might set as table, a graph, a 3d pie chart. how
%>far do you go?
%>

Just a prototype, as it doesn't recognize \\[ ] or \\*, but it can be done. I
haven't tried the graph and pie. But this is more useful than having to put
in all those & and \\ by hand, if the data doesn't contain spaces.

Mike Piff

